If you own, lease, borrow or otherwise lawfully use Genuine Hardware, the Licensor grants you a
free, non-exclusive, worldwide, non-transferable licence, without the right to sublicense, to
install the Software on any number of computers and to use all its functions, with Genuine Hardware
and Accessories, for any purpose, subject to this licence.

No licence is granted to use the Software, or any part of it, with Non-Genuine Hardware, or to
anyone who does not use Genuine Hardware, except as allowed in section 3.

3. Recorded Data and analysis

3.1 You may use the review and analysis functions of the Software only on Recorded Data recorded with
Genuine Hardware, except as allowed in sections 3.2 and 3.3.

3.2 Collaboration and reproducibility. Anyone may use the Software to view and analyse Recorded
Data that was recorded with Genuine Hardware and that a licensed user has shared with them, or that
has been published, for example collaborators, journal editors, reviewers and readers checking or
reproducing research results, whether or not they use Genuine Hardware themselves.

3.3 Evaluation. Anyone may install the Software and use it with the example data supplied by the
Licensor to evaluate it.

3.4 Your data and your results belong to you. The Licensor claims no rights in your Recorded Data,
results, figures or publications.

