Except as allowed by section 8 or by applicable law that cannot be excluded by contract, you may
not, and may not allow others to:

1. use the Software, or any part of it, with Non-Genuine Hardware, or to analyse data recorded with
   Non-Genuine Hardware;
2. remove, disable, bypass or interfere with any licence check, hardware authentication or other
   technical measure in the Software or in Genuine Hardware;
3. reverse engineer, decompile or disassemble the Software or the firmware of Genuine Hardware;
4. modify the Software, or distribute modified versions of it;
5. use the Software, its firmware files, documentation or any part of them to design, make, test,
