6. sell, rent or lease the Software, or offer it as a hosted service to others;
7. remove or alter copyright, licence or trademark notices.

5. Copies and sharing

You may make copies of the unmodified installer and share them, provided that this licence stays
with every copy and no fee is charged for the Software. Every recipient is bound by this licence.

6. Publications

You may publish results, figures, tables and descriptions produced with the Software. The Licensor
asks, but does not require, that publications cite the Software and the FlyPad method
(Itskov et al., 2014, Nature Communications 5:4560).

7. Technical measures, updates and remote support

7.1 The Software may check that it is connected to Genuine Hardware, and may refuse to operate with
other devices.

7.2 Updates are provided at the Licensor's discretion. Each update is licensed under the licence
supplied with it.

7.3 The Software does not send data to the Licensor on its own. Its remote-support function sends
status, log, channel statistics and pictures of the program's windows only after you start it, only
to people to whom you give its access code, through an encrypted connection provided by a
third-party tunnel service (Cloudflare), and stops when you stop it. If you give the code to the
Licensor, the Licensor uses the information received only to provide support and does not keep it
longer than needed for that.

